// An action graph with a cache (docs/MUSEUM.md, GraphMachine): the six-unit workspace of the post. Each node's key is a hash of its
// command (Content) and of the keys of the nodes it Reads. Click a source to edit it; a step settles the next action: a key already in
// the cache is a hit, a new key is a rebuild. Names are absolute em positions inside the Extent.
workspace : Preset {
  Title: {"six-unit workspace"}
  build_rs : Source {
    Icon: {"rust"}
    Label: {"build.rs"}
    Content: {"fn main emit schema"}
    Place: {1, 4.3, 7.4, 1.8}
  }
